{"steam_appid":2202770,"steam_name":"Pizza Hero","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2202770/715652/364ea31c2a75e32b211704da4e99019a12bde163/1751089384/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1718759769","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257032175/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1718759769","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/ss_0c52ce07942d6bdce2112f52fb7daf075682a6d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748629950","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/ss_a7f880b146e2dff1c37ab1522e4c3127bfcea695.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748629950","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/ss_4d316d08ca828833cd7fc8391aff2bf89419ade3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748629950","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/ss_673a78913fd11fcbacf0262ba97d717f1e77df3a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748629950","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/ss_f353dd1298af11e96472580c4e2487d982ce02f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748629950"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRODUCTION</h2> Welcome to Pizza Hero, the exciting new shoot 'em up roguelite that puts a delicious twist on the genre! In this game, you'll play as a brave pizza who must defend the world from an invasion of enemies.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/64b60c46c0da9dbf161c7d37ae8103a6.poster.avif?t=1748629950\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/64b60c46c0da9dbf161c7d37ae8103a6.webm?t=1748629950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/64b60c46c0da9dbf161c7d37ae8103a6.mp4?t=1748629950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>As you battle your way through the game, you'll have the opportunity to choose from a variety of different toppings that will grant you special abilities. For example, selecting pepperoni will give you a grenade, allowing you to deal splash damage. Or, if you're feeling saucy, you can choose blue cheese to create a pungent perimeter around your pizza, damaging any foes that come too close.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/fbeea2875e75f20b31c594d2d6ff32b2.poster.avif?t=1748629950\" width=594 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/fbeea2875e75f20b31c594d2d6ff32b2.webm?t=1748629950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/fbeea2875e75f20b31c594d2d6ff32b2.mp4?t=1748629950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2>Pizza Hero is a swarm survivor, meaning that you'll need to use all of your skills and strategies to take down waves of relentless enemies. With randomly generated levels and power-ups, no two playthroughs are ever the same. To help you in your quest, the game features an auto-rotate feature that allows you to easily switch between targeting groups without having to manually rotate.<br><br><br>So if you're ready to rise to the challenge and defend the world from the forces of evil, play Pizza Hero now!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/a2ebe284850ab1c6304ae443f361b9d6.poster.avif?t=1748629950\" width=686 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/a2ebe284850ab1c6304ae443f361b9d6.webm?t=1748629950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/a2ebe284850ab1c6304ae443f361b9d6.mp4?t=1748629950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT OVERVIEW</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15+ Damage Toppings<br></li><li>6+ Passive Toppings<br></li><li>Upgradable overall stats<br></li><li>Auto rotate/firing controls (with option to focus different enemy types - Tank, Damage and Support)<br></li><li>Endless gameplay<br></li><li>Survive waves to unlock the next stage</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/324e6f3d7a977f40a6350c3064c9feac.poster.avif?t=1748629950\" width=610 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/324e6f3d7a977f40a6350c3064c9feac.webm?t=1748629950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202770/extras/324e6f3d7a977f40a6350c3064c9feac.mp4?t=1748629950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING</h2> This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo CPU (or AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Astro Hound"],"publishers":["Astro Hound"],"release_date":"27 Jun, 2024"}